{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QP21FfSQxx1795515169.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>周大福上半年度多賺逾九成八。</p><p></p><p>截至9月底止半年純利50.3億元，派中期息每股0.35元，按年增加五成九。派息比率由去年同期約八成半，下降至約六成八。期內，營業額逾442億元，上升一成三。毛利率收窄4.9個百分點，至百分之25.6。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:03:53.926222+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:14.240041+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:57:16.558178+00:00","content_hash":"f16de14f33f8b0fa50d58f1a2d433b87a77246442295474f4e09b16289170097","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:03:53.926222+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}